        "cash_earned": 0,
        "created_at": "2025-08-14T23:34:46.010477+00:00",
        "notes": "Some options between powers, so here's a lot of text to explain them:\n- [Cleansing Charge](item_4721f307-30d2-4fc1-a10b-6de7141deb68): My go-to choice usually, as with your CDR (which is going to get higher) alongside [Two-Zu](item_80f16d3e-a4c0-4fa8-90b1-a0f033a1a77b) this will really speed up getting your ult. If the enemy team doesn't really have effects you can cleanse, then if you and/or your teammates get [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8), that also counts as something you can cleanse, and all you need to do is take any form of damage!\n- [Leaf on the Wind](item_b64de259-d122-407d-a7e4-9d7267310704): For even more healing, and for the passive buffs to spread to more of your team! If the enemies don't really have anything for [Cleansing Charge](item_4721f307-30d2-4fc1-a10b-6de7141deb68), and you don't think your team will get [Nebula Conduit](item_476b7040-54c9-4f0c-8283-b4407f6809f8), then this is a decent power choice.\n- [Self-Care](item_0b7b0332-9bf6-4905-810e-7614b914d663): If you're struggling to get healed or feel like you need more survivability, this is a good choice.\n\nNothing special about the item choices this round, we finally have everything we wanted, from now on out it's icing on the cake",
